    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabili Yosaya acindikile Yawe mukusefya Ipasaka",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35:1",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ipasaka:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Lishiwi lya Cihibulu ilyalola mukutila “ukucilila,” moneni Ukufuma 12:13 kabili moneni mu mashiwi ya mu Baibele ku mpela.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", inshikunkulu ya Cakucilila, mu Yerusalemu, elyo na pa bushiku bwalenga ikumi limo na shine (14) aipaya umwana wa mpaanga wakusefesha Ipasaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abika bashimapepo mu fifulo fyabo ifyakubombelamo no kubakoselesha mu milimo ya mu ŋanda yakwa Yawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo aeba abena Levi, abali na mano yakufunda abena Israeli kabili abali abatuulwa kuli Yawe ati, “Bikeni Imbokoshi ya Cipangano mu ŋanda yakwa Yawe iyo Solomoni mwana Davidi imfumu ya bena Israeli yakuulile. Tamufwile ukusendela pa mabeya yenu. Eico nomba ambeni ukutumika Yawe Lesa wenu elyo na bantu bakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.8.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Imila 8:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iteyanyeni mu ndupwa shenu mu mpuka mu mpuka ukulingana ne fyakonkomeshe Davidi imfumu ya bena Israeli no mwana wakwe Solomoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwiminine mu cifulo camushilo na kabungwe ka bena Levi pali cila mpuka sha ndupwa sha bekalacalo banenu abo ababomba mukwafwilisha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo mwipaye abana ba mpaanga ba pe Pasaka. Muisangulule mwe bene no kupekanya abana ba mpaanga ba bamunyinenwe, no kucita ifyo Yawe amukonkomeshe ukupitila muli Mose.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosaya epakupeela abo ababomba mukwafwilisha abana ba mpaanga na ba mbushi amakana amakumi yatatu (30,000) ishakupeela umutuulo we Pasaka elyo na bacilume ba ŋombe amakana yatatu (3,000), ifi fyonse fyafumine pa fyakwete imfumu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bacilolo bakwe bacita cimo cine, mukuitemenwa bapeela ku bantu na kuli bashimapepo elyo na ku bena Levi. Elyo Hilikiya, Sakaria na Yehieli bacilolo ba mu ŋanda yakwa Lesa bapeela bashimapepo abana ba mpaanga na ba mbushi amakana yabili ne myanda mutanda (2,600) ishakutuula pe Pasaka elyo na bacilume ba ŋombe imyanda itatu (300). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabili Konaniya pamo pene na Shemaiya na Netaneli bamunyina, elyo Hashabiya, Yehieli, Yosabadi, abali ni ntungulushi sha bena Levi, nabo bapeele abana ba mpaanga na ba mbushi amakana yasano (5,000) ishakutuula pe Pasaka elyo na bacilume ba ŋombe imyanda isano (500) isha ku bena Levi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilyo fyonse fyapekanishiwe ifya pakusefya Ipasaka, inshikunkulu ya Cakucilila, bashimapepo baiminine mu ncende shabo ishakubombelamo na bena Levi nabo mu mpuka shabo ngefyo imfumu yakonkomeshe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abena Levi epakwipaya abana ba mpaanga be Pasaka, babuula umulopa bapeela bashimapepo nabo baukana, elyo bapwishishisha ukuputaula inama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo bapatulapo inama ishakutuula ilambo lyakoca bapeela ku mpuka sha ndupwa sha bekalacalo abali nokutuula kuli Yawe ngefyo calembwa mu citabo cakwa Mose. Kabili bacita cimo cine kuli bacilume ba ŋombe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.12.8+EXO.12.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ukuf 12:8-9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baoca inama ye Pasaka pa mulilo ngefyo calembwa elyo ishamushilo shonse bashipika mu malongo, mu mipika na mu nongo elyo bashipeela na ku bekalacalo bonse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Panuma ya ifi, elyo nabo baipekanishisha elyo bapekanishishako na bashimapepo. Bacitile ifi pantu bashimapepo, aba mu lupwa lwakwa Aroni, bali no mulimo wakutuula amalambo yakoca pamo ne nama sha mafuta mpaka ubushiku. Kanshi ecalengele abena Levi ukuipekanishisha abene no kupekanishishako aba mu lupwa lwakwa Aroni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakemba, aba mu lupwa lwakwa Asafu bonse, bali mu ncende shabo ukulingana nefyo Davidi, Asafu, Hemani na Yedutuni uwali kamona wa mfumu basosele. Bakalinda wa cila mpongolo tabafumine pa milimo yabo, pantu abena Levi banabo balibapekanishishe ifyakulya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi efyo imilimo yonse iyakwa Yawe yabombeke, iyakusefya Ipasaka elyo ne yakutuula amalambo yakoca pa bulambo bwakwa Yawe ngefyo imfumu Yosaya yakonkomeshe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ifi efyo abena Israeli abasangilwepo pali ilya nshita basefeshe Ipasaka ne nshikunkulu ya mikate iyishatutumuka pa nshiku cine lubali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Takwaliko Ipasaka ilyo basefeshe muli uyu musango ukufuma mu nshiku shakwa kasesema Samwele. Elyo kabili takwatalile akuba imfumu ya bena Israeli iyatalile aisefya Ipasaka ngefyo Yosaya acitile na bashimapepo bakwe abena Levi, abena Yuda elyo na bena Israeli bonse abali pamo na bantu ba mu Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwali ukusefya ili Ipasaka mu mwaka walenga ikumi limo na cine konse konse (18) uwa pa bufumu bwakwa Yosaya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Panuma ya ifi fyonse, ilyo Yosaya apwishishe ukuwamya Itempele, Neko imfumu ya ku Egupto yaima ukuya ku bulwi pa Kakemishi ku mumana wa Yufurate, nao Yosaya aima aya kukumulwisha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lelo Neko atuma inkombe shakuya mweba amashiwi yakuti, “Bushe mulandu nshi iwe na ine twalalwila we mfumu ya bena Yuda? Ine teiwe njishile mukulwisha, lelo ndeya mukulwishafye iŋanda imbi. Lesa eunjebele ukwendesha, eico leka ukulwisha Lesa uuntumine pantu alekonaulapofye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lelo Yosaya akaana ukumfwa nokuti abweleko, ena aifungushanya atendeka no kumulwisha. Afilwa ukumfwa amashiwi yakwa Neko ayo Lesa amukonkomeshe, lelo aya mukumulwisha mwiwanga lya Megido.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
